    ///
    /// # Parameters
    ///
    /// - `stream_handle`: \[in\] Bitstream handle.
    /// - `component_id`: \[in\] Component index (0..`num_components-1)`.
    /// - `nlt_info`: \[out\] Pointer to `nvjpeg2kNLTInfo_t` to populate.
